---
title: "Embedding a deck"
---

A `{{< embed >}}` pulls another document's **deck** view into this page as an
isolated iframe. The deck is built as a standalone `.html` beside this page (kept
out of the site nav) and the iframe resolves to it:

{{< embed talk.tmd >}}

Everything below the embed is ordinary page prose, so the embedded deck is one
component of an article rather than a page of its own.
